  "uncertain": [
    "Grouping of the five inner pads (GPIO23, GPIO22, GPIO21, GPIO12, GPIO13): they are scattered through-holes, not a single row; split into pad-23, pads-21-22 and pads-12-13 by physical proximity. GPIO21/GPIO22 lie on a diagonal, so their order is a judgment."
  ],
  "notes": "Third-party (mischianti.org) pinout titled 'ESP32-C6 Super Mini (MakerGO)'; image shows front with callouts plus a back view. Board silkscreen (front) recorded first in functions when it differs, then the dark number box. Front silkscreen 'BAT' near the top right pad and '15' near the top left are beside LEDs/pads not in the header and were not used. Battery pads B+/B- are read from the back view's silkscreen. Skipped per rule 1: BOOT/RST buttons, USB-C, ceramic antenna (C3)."
